{
  "name": "scifi_radar_panel",
  "_comment": "Sci-fi radar console over scifi_radar_panel_wall.png. The layout is authored in the KIOSK SCREEN's pixels (1080x1920) and the artwork is that same PNG pre-scaled once to the same size, because a canvas that is not the screen's size makes the compositor smoothscale every frame: measured 21.2 ms/frame at the artwork's native 816x1440 versus 5.6 ms at 1080x1920 on this wall. The overlay coordinates below are the measured artwork positions multiplied by the SAME transform that made the wall PNG (x * 1080/816, y * 1920/1440), so art and overlays cannot drift apart. The art supplies the bezels, dial faces, screens and button wells; controls draw only their animated overlays. Re-align via the control-panel layout page after looking at the wall.",
  "mode": "freeform",
